SUMMARY:Leanne Morgan: THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR LIVE at The Orpheum Theat
	re Memphis (Sunday Matinee)
DTSTAMP:20260823T033708Z
DTSTART:20260823T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Leanne Morgan\nLeanne
	 Morgan is one of the most beloved stand-up comedians in America today\, k
	nown for her warm Southern charm\, razor-sharp wit\, and deeply relatable 
	humor about family life\, marriage\, and the hilarious realities of gettin
	g older. \nHailing from Tennessee\, Leanne spent years performing at small
	 clubs before her career exploded thanks to viral social media clips and h
	er Netflix special I’m Every Woman. Her comedy resonates with audiences of
	 all ages — especially women who see their own lives reflected in her stor
	ies about husbands\, kids\, and the chaos of everyday Southern living. \nF
	ans can expect a night filled with laugh-out-loud storytelling\, relatable
	 observations\, and the kind of genuine warmth that makes Leanne Morgan on
	e of the most in-demand comedians on the road today. \nEvent Details\n\nDa
	te: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026\nTime: 4:00 PM (Doors open approximately 1 h
	our prior)\nVenue: The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\nAddress: 203 S. Main St.\,
	 Memphis\, TN 38103\nTicket Prices: $95 – $816+\nContent Advisory: Adult h
	umor\; recommended for ages 18+\n\nAbout The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\nThe 
	Orpheum Theatre Memphis is one of the most iconic and storied entertainmen
	t venues in the American South. Originally opened in 1928\, this stunning 
	historic theater seats approximately 2\,400 guests and is renowned for its
	 breathtaking Beaux-Arts architecture\, ornate chandeliers\, and plush sea
	ting that transports audiences to a golden era of live entertainment. \nLo
	cated in the heart of downtown Memphis at 203 S. Main St.\, the Orpheum si
	ts just steps from the legendary Beale Street entertainment district. The 
	venue offers excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house\,
	 with sections including the Orchestra\, Mezzanine\, Grand Tier\, Balcony\
	, and Gallery levels. \nAmenities include multiple concession stands\, ful
	l bar service\, and accessible seating options throughout the theater. Par
	king is available in nearby garages and surface lots along Main Street and
	 in the surrounding downtown area. The venue is also accessible via the Ma
	in Street Trolley line. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy p
	erformance by Leanne Morgan as part of her THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR — a 
	nationwide headline tour celebrating her meteoric rise to comedy stardom. 
	The Sunday matinee show at 4:00 PM is a rare afternoon performance\, makin
	g it a perfect option for fans who prefer an earlier show time. \nExpect a
	pproximately 90 minutes of non-stop laughter as Leanne takes the stage at 
	the magnificent Orpheum. Her storytelling style is conversational and inti
	mate\, even in a large theater setting — she has a gift for making every a
	udience member feel like she’s talking directly to them. \nWhether you’re 
	a longtime fan or discovering Leanne Morgan for the first time\, this show
	 promises to be an unforgettable evening (or afternoon!) of comedy in one 
	of Memphis’s most beautiful venues. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Lean
	ne Morgan at The Orpheum Theatre Memphis on August 23\, 2026 (4:00 PM) are
	 available now. Prices range from $95 to $816+ depending on seat location 
	and availability. \nPurchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaste
	r\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats for a wide selection of seat
	 options. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affil
	iate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links
	 at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to cha
	nge. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.c
	om/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-tour-live-at-the-orpheum-thea
	tre-memphis-sunday-matinee/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-to
	ur-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-sunday-matinee/
LOCATION:The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN\, 381
	03\, United States Of America
