SUMMARY:Tony Dabas LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260823T033708Z
DTSTART:20260823T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout Tony Dabas\nTony Dabas 
	is a stand-up comedian with over 13 years of experience performing in club
	s across the country. Known for embodying a wide range of characters and v
	oices\, he blends stand-up with sharp character work and accents drawn fro
	m his diverse background. His ability to seamlessly shift between personas
	 and dialects has made him one of the most distinctive voices in comedy to
	day. \nDabas started his career opening for comedians nationwide\, working
	 his way through respected venues including Improv rooms and major comedy 
	clubs across the U.S. Over the past year\, he has transitioned into headli
	ning\, touring as a featured act across multiple cities. He has opened for
	 notable comedians including Felipe Esparza and performers from Saturday N
	ight Live. \nIn addition to his live performances\, Tony has built a massi
	ve presence on social media\, creating viral sketch content that reaches m
	illions of viewers each month. His unique blend of character comedy\, acce
	nts\, and relatable storytelling has earned him a dedicated fanbase that s
	pans across demographics. Catch him live before he becomes a household nam
	e. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nShow Time: 6:00 PM E
	DT (Doors open at 4:30 PM) \nVenue: Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St
	\, Cary\, NC 27519 \nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid photo ID required for ent
	ry) \nTicket Prices: $26.67 – $101.73 (includes fees and taxes) \nNote: Th
	ere is a two-item minimum purchase requirement in the showroom for all gue
	sts. No cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted dur
	ing performances. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle ar
	ea’s premier comedy club\, located at 1224 Parkside Main St in Cary\, NC —
	 just minutes from downtown Raleigh. Part of the nationally recognized Imp
	rov Comedy Club chain\, the Raleigh Improv has hosted some of the biggest 
	names in stand-up comedy and continues to be the go-to destination for wor
	ld-class comedy in the Research Triangle. \nThe venue features a full-serv
	ice restaurant and bar\, offering guests a complete dining and entertainme
	nt experience. Seating is general admission and first-come\, first-served\
	, with the exception of reserved groups and premium booths. Premium booth 
	options include a $200 food and beverage credit per booth\, making it a gr
	eat choice for special occasions or group outings. \nThe intimate showroom
	 setting ensures every seat has a great view of the stage\, creating an up
	-close and personal comedy experience. The venue is conveniently located i
	n the Parkside Town Commons shopping center\, with ample parking available
	. The Raleigh Improv is a 21+ venue\, so be sure to bring a valid photo ID
	. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Dabas delivers a kinetic\, high-energy performanc
	e packed with characters\, voices\, and rapid-fire crowd work. His sets fe
	el spontaneous and alive — no two shows are exactly alike because he feeds
	 off the energy of the room and improvises in real time. Expect to see a c
	omedian who can make you laugh with a single look\, a perfectly timed acce
	nt\, or a character that feels like someone you actually know. \nThis is a
	 solo headlining show\, giving you a full evening with one of comedy’s mos
	t exciting emerging talents. Dabas’s style is accessible and inclusive — h
	is humor draws from universal experiences while showcasing his unique mult
	icultural perspective. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him fo
	r the first time\, this show promises to be a memorable night of laughs. \
	nArrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy dinner and drinks before the 
	show. The two-item minimum ensures you’ll be well-fed and ready to laugh. 
	This is a 21+ event\, so leave the kids at home and enjoy a proper adults-
	only night out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $26.67 – $101.73 (inclu
	des fees and taxes) \nTicket options include General Admission ($20 + fees
	)\, GA Booth for 4 ($70 + fees)\, VIP Ticket ($35 + fees)\, and VIP Premiu
	m Booth for 4 ($85 + fees). All sales are final. No refunds\, transfers\, 
	or exchanges. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our lin
	ks at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to c
	hange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/tony-dabas-live-at-raleigh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
