SUMMARY:12th Annual Desi Comedy Fest LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacrame
	nto
DTSTAMP:20260823T033708Z
DTSTART:20260823T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\nAbout the Desi Comedy Fest\nT
	he Desi Comedy Fest is one of the most celebrated South Asian comedy showc
	ases in the United States\, now in its 12th year. Founded to showcase the 
	best South Asian and South Asian-American comedians\, the festival has gro
	wn into a beloved institution that brings together some of the funniest vo
	ices from the Desi comedy community. \nThis year’s Sacramento edition feat
	ures Samson Koletkar\, one of the most acclaimed South Asian comedians wor
	king today. Known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and ability 
	to bridge the gap between South Asian and American experiences\, Samson de
	livers a comedy show that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nT
	he Desi Comedy Fest is a celebration of diversity\, culture\, and the univ
	ersal power of laughter. Whether you’re South Asian or simply a fan of gre
	at comedy\, this show promises to be an unforgettable evening of laughs. \
	nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors ope
	n one hour before the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\,
	 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-
	beverage minimum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Co
	medy Club Sacramento is one of the most celebrated comedy venues on the We
	st Coast\, located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. The intim
	ate club seats approximately 300 guests in a tiered layout that ensures ex
	cellent sightlines from every seat. \nThe venue features a full bar and di
	ning service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The warm\, welcoming
	 atmosphere and professional sound system make it the ideal setting for an
	 evening of world-class stand-up comedy. Parking is available in the surro
	unding area. \nPunch Line Sacramento has hosted legends of comedy and cont
	inues to be the premier destination for live stand-up in the Sacramento re
	gion. \nWhat to Expect\nThe 12th Annual Desi Comedy Fest is a multi-comedi
	an showcase featuring some of the best South Asian stand-up talent in the 
	country. Expect a diverse lineup of comedians bringing their unique perspe
	ctives on culture\, identity\, family\, and the immigrant experience — all
	 wrapped in hilarious\, relatable comedy. \nThe show runs approximately 90
	 minutes and is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. This is a unique
	 opportunity to experience the vibrant world of Desi comedy in an intimate
	 club setting. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $70 (includes fees
	) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options 
	through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains
	 affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our
	 links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject 
	to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycale
	ndar.com/event/desi-comedy-fest-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/desi-comedy-fest-live-at-punch-line-co
	medy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\
	, CA\, 95825
