SUMMARY:Leanne Morgan: THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR LIVE at The Orpheum Theat
	re Memphis (Sunday)
DTSTAMP:20260823T033708Z
DTSTART:20260823T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLeanne Mo
	rgan is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy\, beloved for her warm
	\, Southern charm and hilariously relatable humor about marriage\, motherh
	ood\, and middle age. The Tennessee native has taken the comedy world by s
	torm with her authentic\, feel-good style. \nMorgan’s Netflix special and 
	viral social media presence have earned her a massive\, devoted fanbase. H
	er comedy resonates especially with women who see their own lives reflecte
	d in her stories — but her universal appeal brings in audiences of all bac
	kgrounds. \nThe Time of Our Lives Tour features all-new material and marks
	 a triumphant return to Memphis\, where Morgan has previously sold out sho
	ws. This is a three-night run at the Orpheum — don’t miss your chance to s
	ee her live! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00
	 PM CDT \nVenue: The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\,
	 TN 38103 \nNote: This is the Sunday night performance. Friday (Aug 21) an
	d Saturday (Aug 22) shows are also available. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Orphe
	um Theatre Memphis is one of the most storied and beautiful performing art
	s venues in the American South. Built in 1928\, this stunning historic the
	ater seats approximately 2\,300 guests and is renowned for its ornate arch
	itecture\, crystal chandeliers\, and exceptional acoustics. \nLocated at 2
	03 S. Main Street in the heart of downtown Memphis\, the Orpheum is steps 
	away from Beale Street and the city’s vibrant entertainment district. The 
	venue offers orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony seating\, with excellent 
	sightlines throughout. \nParking is available in nearby garages and surfac
	e lots. The Orpheum’s intimate atmosphere makes it one of the best places 
	in Memphis to experience live comedy — close enough to feel every punchlin
	e. \nWhat to Expect\nLeanne Morgan performs a solo stand-up set featuring 
	all-new material from The Time of Our Lives Tour. The show is family-frien
	dly and runs approximately 75–90 minutes. \nMorgan’s performances are know
	n for their warmth\, laughter\, and the feeling that you’re spending an ev
	ening with your funniest friend. Expect a joyful\, feel-good night that wi
	ll have you laughing from start to finish. \nTicket Information\nPrice Ran
	ge: From $117 and up (fees may apply) \nPurchase official tickets through 
	Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets
	Resale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commiss
	ion at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-mo
	rgan-the-time-of-our-lives-tour-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-sunday
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-to
	ur-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-sunday/
LOCATION:The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN\, 381
	03\, United States Of America
