SUMMARY:Greg Fitzsimmons LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club - Columbus
DTSTAMP:20260823T033709Z
DTSTART:20260827T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nGreg Fitzsimmons LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club
	 – Columbus\nEmmy Award-winning comedian and podcast host Greg Fitzsimmons
	 brings his razor-sharp wit and brutally honest stand-up to the Funny Bone
	 Comedy Club in Columbus\, Ohio for one night only on August 27\, 2026. Kn
	own for his no-holds-barred style and fearless storytelling\, this is a mu
	st-see night of comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026
	\nTime: Doors 5:30 PM / Show 7:00 PM\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club – Colu
	mbus\nAddress: 145 Easton Town Center\, Columbus\, OH 43219\nAge Requireme
	nt: Ages 21 and up\nParking: Available at Easton Town Center \nAbout Greg 
	Fitzsimmons\nGreg Fitzsimmons is an Emmy Award-winning writer and stand-up
	 comedian who has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Late Show with David Lett
	erman\, and Conan. He is the host of the popular podcast “FitzDog Radio” a
	nd has written for Howard Stern\, Ellen DeGeneres\, and many other major T
	V shows. His stand-up is known for being raw\, honest\, and hilariously se
	lf-deprecating. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, no-holds-barred stand-up comed
	y from a seasoned pro\nBrutally honest observations on marriage\, family\,
	 and everyday life\nAn intimate club setting at one of Columbus’s premier 
	comedy venues\nFull bar and dining available at the Funny Bone\nA night of
	 laughs you won’t forget\n\nVenue Information\nThe Funny Bone Comedy Club 
	– Columbus is located in the heart of Easton Town Center\, offering a prem
	ier comedy club experience with full bar service\, dining\, and an intimat
	e stage setting perfect for stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets
	 range from $27 to $32. Resale tickets are also available. Secure your sea
	ts early as this show is expected to sell out. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResal
	e Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if y
	ou purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales 
	are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required fo
	r entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/greg-fitzsimmons-live-at-funn
	y-bone-comedy-club-columbus/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/greg-fitzsimmons-live-at-funny-bone-co
	medy-club-columbus/
