SUMMARY:Vic DiBitetto LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260823T033709Z
DTSTART:20260827T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nVic DiBit
	etto is an incredibly powerful performer who churns energy\, honesty\, and
	 humanity into nonstop laughter. His pace is frenetic\, he holds no hostag
	es\, and he has been called a cross between Rodney Dangerfield\, Ralph Kra
	mden\, and a hurricane. The bottom line: DiBitetto leaves his audiences br
	eathless with laughter. \nA successful national headliner who regularly se
	lls out theaters across the US\, Vic is an internet sensation with over 50
	0 million views worldwide. He was featured in Kevin James’ film Mall Cop 2
	\, regularly appears on the nationally syndicated daytime TV show Right Th
	is Minute\, and has headlined the Three Tenors (Who Can’t Sing) Tour acros
	s the country. \nVic has appeared on America’s Funniest People (ABC) where
	 he was a $10\,000 Grand Prize winner\, as well as Stand-Up Spotlight (VH1
	). His NY Giants and NY Yankees videos are frequently discussed on ESPN\, 
	YES Network\, and WFAN radio\, making him a beloved figure both in comedy 
	clubs and sports media alike. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\
	, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\n
	Address: 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519\nAge Restriction: 21+ (va
	lid ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required in the showroom
	 for all guests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle are
	a’s premier comedy club\, located in the heart of Cary’s Parkside Town Com
	mons. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Ral
	eigh Improv offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere where every seat fe
	els close to the stage. \nThe venue features general admission seating (fi
	rst-come\, first-served) as well as premium booth options that include a $
	200 food and beverage credit. The full-service bar and kitchen menu make i
	t easy to enjoy dinner and drinks before and during the show. \nParking is
	 available in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center lots. 
	The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient f
	or guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding are
	as. \nWhat to Expect\nVic DiBitetto is the kind of comedian who grabs the 
	room from the first second and never lets go. His high-energy\, no-holds-b
	arred style is equal parts hilarious and heartfelt — expect big laughs\, b
	ig personality\, and the kind of raw\, relatable humor that has made him o
	ne of the most beloved comics working today. \nThis is a 21+ Thursday nigh
	t show with an intimate club atmosphere. Arrive early to grab your seats\,
	 order from the full menu\, and get ready for a performance that will have
	 you laughing from start to finish. Don’t miss one of stand-up’s most expl
	osive live acts. \nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is
	 permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Informati
	on\nPrice Range: $30 – $80 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through Tick
	etmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tick
	ets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no e
	xtra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/vic-dibitetto-live-a
	t-raleigh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
